-- The DAO contract of section 7 (S10, Q-S10-3 .. Q-S10-7 (a)). A kit file:
-- each constant comes from the host (the tags, the ring and the share keys of
-- examples/ballot.lang; the rest from `build/ballottool dao`). The name
-- dao.lang is the S7 guest prelude, so this file is daokit.lang (DEVIATION 2).
-- A cast is four calls under the nullifier N = hash (hash ix iy) poll (the
-- zkcast key, O33): castSig checks the ring signature over the 8 slot
-- ciphertext words and keeps them in pend at hash N k (k = 4 j + i, slot j,
-- word i of c1x c1y c2x c2y); castSlot checks the OR proof of slot j on the
-- kept words; castSeal checks the sum proof, adds slot 0 to T0 and slot 1 to
-- T1 (the c1 and c2 points, from (0, 0), the identity of ecAdd) and marks N
-- used. stage holds 1 at N after castSig and 1 at hash N j after the proof of
-- slot j; a second castSig of a pending N starts N again. enactKit opens T0 with
-- the shares of the quorum {1, 2} (the Lagrange constants l1 l2 are contract
-- constants, O31): yes = m, no = casts - yes, and the window moves to the
-- proposal when yes > no (a tie keeps it). The fill and cancel are slice b5.
state State := makeState (used : Map U256 Flag) (pend : Map U256 U256) (stage : Map U256 U256) (t0ax : U256) (t0ay : U256) (t0bx : U256) (t0by : U256) (t1ax : U256) (t1ay : U256) (t1bx : U256) (t1by : U256) (casts : U256) (castEnd : U256) (proposal : U256) (window : U256) (enacted : Flag) (keys : Map U256 Flag) (fills : Map U256 U256) (seq : U256)

-- castEnd 12, proposal 4, window 6, seq 0. seq is the count of entries done (S3, no time): each
-- entry adds 1, a castSeal needs seq <= castEnd and enactKit needs seq > castEnd.
def init : State :=
  makeState mapEmpty mapEmpty mapEmpty 0u 0u 0u 0u 0u 0u 0u 0u 0u 12u 4u 6u flagNo mapEmpty mapEmpty 0u

